OL,3,GNEWSAFears MoD asylum centre could
OL,4,A'risk' war readiness
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over the use
OL,7,Fof military land to house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers and the impact it could have on
OL,9,Fthe country's readiness for war.
OL,11,FCalum Miller, Liberal Democrat MP for
OL,12,FBicester and Woodstock, said Site A at
OL,13,FMoD Bicester was still being used to
OL,14,Ftrain bomb disposal units and using it
OL,15,Fas an asylum centre "put at risk our
OL,16,Fpreparedness" for conflict.
OL,18,FIt comes after the defence secretary,
OL,19,FWes Streeting, said Britain must be
OL,20,Fready for war in a 1,000 days.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
