OL,3,GNEWSAFears MoD asylum centre could
OL,4,A'risk' war readiness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Home Office said
OL,7,Fthe use of former military sites was
OL,8,Fpart of plans to close asylum hotels
OL,9,F"with over #1bn saved in costs since
OL,10,Fthe election".
